# Denali first customer (P6)

Close **end-to-end Denali product** for the first club — three **separate apps** on **separate subdomains**, guest journey **before** full admin polish.

**Not in P6:** metadata cutover, gateway/commerce (P5-C/D/E), Urban, installments.

---

## Three apps (frozen)

| Surface | App | Dev host | Prod host |
| ------- | --- | -------- | --------- |
| **Public** | `apps/marketing` | `shop.{club}.localhost:3002` | `shop.{club}.{root}` |
| **User** | `apps/portal` | `{club}.localhost:3003` | `{club}.portal.{root}` |
| **Admin** | `apps/web` `(app)/` | `{club}.localhost:3000` | `{club}.admin.{root}` |

All three resolve the **same `tenantId`** from host via `GET /public/tenant-context`.

---

## Problem today

Admin routes mostly exist but **flows do not connect**:

```text
Admin builds tour  ✗→  Public catalog empty/wrong tenant
                   ✗→  Portal register unreachable
```

**P6 priority:** guest can **browse → register** first; **full admin** second; **member `/me`** third.

